{%- case field -%}
{%- when 'group' -%}wellness
{%- when 'wellness' -%}
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Someone with hairfall or thinning of hair<br> Someone with male pattern baldness<br> If you need volume, thickness and strength in the hair<br> Someone searching for an Ayurvedic hair oil</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Hibiscus Infused Oil, Sweet Almond Oil, Castor Seed Oil, Coconut Oil, Jojoba Oil, Rose Petals, Curry Leaves, Hibiscus Leaves, Methi Leaves, Lemon Peels, Whole Ginger, Kalonji, Brahmi Infused Oil, Almond Oil, Lotus Oil, Krishna-Kamal Infused Oil, Edible Camphor, Rosemary Leaves, Cedar Wood Infused Oil, Hibiscus Flowers, Hibiscus Leaves, Lemon Infused Oil, Vitamin E, Ginger Infused Oil, Orange Peel Infused Oil, Jasmine Infused Oil, Star Anise Extract.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This hair oil targets extreme hairfall, balding &amp; thinning of hair. It is infused for hours in brass vessels, thus retaining the best nutritional properties of the ingredients. Practice your Champi ritual with this oil twice a week.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This hair oil is unique because it shows results within a month. It has the best ingredients that are infused for hours in brass vessels and is 100% natural and organic. It is suitable for all hair types and treats the scalp with Ayurvedic ingredients.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
{%- endcase -%}
